    {
      "heading": "A new foothold in the top 100",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Heminator climbs 158 places from the midnight baseline to 93rd at 37.36, adding 4.86 points and clearing the closing silver score of 33.06. The score-event log catches the improvement from 254th; the edition’s net place gain starts from a different snapshot. Team Alicia also advances, gaining 29 places to 126th at 34.86."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The front four stand firm",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-30-0403-arc-2-charles-ran-enters-gold",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs leads at 88.06, ahead of Yi-Chia Chen @ Fields Model on 87.22. nvbanana remains third at 83.89, with Domdolus Tolus fourth at 83.47. None of those four improves its score against the midnight baseline. The overnight Charles Ran wire reports a climb from 53rd to twelfth at 73.89 over its wider reporting window, carrying the entry into the public gold band; that is dated wire context rather than a new midnight-to-close gain."
    },
    {
      "heading": "More movement beneath the medals",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "The recorded thisray event takes its score from 38.61 to 51.67 and its event-time rank from 86th to 57th. Nuno Ferreira closes 251st at 32.64, gaining 28 places against midnight. ARC Mutants slips one place to 63rd while retaining 46.39. Public medal positions remain provisional. Social and discussion research was not refreshed; the held Domdolus Tolus people feature retains its separate release conditions."
